      56.49,
      412.5,
      295.1,
      444.06
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the LandAcquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the followinglands which are required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.61,
      453.78,
      202.75,
      463.74
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.49,
      471.54,
      295.31,
      546.3
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 - 05 (Lots 5) allotments in total extent of about 0.2806Hectare of land in Preliminary Plan No. Gam: 3938 and dated29.12.2014 prepared by the Surveyor-Superintendent on behalf ofSurveyor- Puttalam, General situated in the Village of Manaweriyain the Gramaniladhari Division 67 - A Manaweriya in the MinorDivision of Dunugaha paththuwa of Divisional Secretary\u2019s Divisionof Katana in Gampaha District in the Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.49,
      555.06,
      295.32,
      608.22
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 1Name of land: Bridgeland watta; Description: Garden, Contains atemporary building and Part of the temporary building; Claimant:State; Original Claimant: D. R. Erauwala, No. 65/1, Chilaw Road,Manaweriya, Kochchikade; Extent: 0.0348 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.49,
      619.86,
      295.33,
      694.62
    ],
    "text": "02. Lot No. 2Name of land: Bridgeland watta; Description: Garden, ContainsNo. of 3 part of the permanent building, Masonry well with and No.of 8 Coconut trees about 30 years and No. of 4 Jack trees about 30years; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: D. P. A. P. Jayawardhana,No. 153, Chilaw Road, Manaweriya, Kochchikade; Extent: 0.1045Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.49,
      706.26,
      295.11,
      748.62
    ],
    "text": "03. Lot No. 3Name of land: Bridgeland watta; Description: Garden, Contains APermanent building, A Part of the permanent building, A Part of thetemporary building with and 3 Coconut trees about 30 years and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.05,
      335.7,
      547.08,
      367.26
    ],
    "text": "One Jack tree about 30 years; Claimant: State; Original Claimant:K. V. Jayawardhana, Chilaw Road, Manaweriya, Kochchikade;Extent: 0.0833 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
